the id columns below must agree with it (ck_asv_scope_ids).']
  asvCompanyId String
  asvBranchId String
  asvDeviceId String
  asvUserId String
  asvValue String [note: 'Stored as text for every type; fn_app_settings casts on the way out.
NULL = "explicitly nothing", distinct from no row at all ("inherit").']
  asvRemarks String
  asvIsDeleted Boolean [not null, default: false]
  asvSyncDate DateTime
  asvCreatedOn DateTime [default: `now()`, not null]
  asvCreatedBy String [not null]
  asvModifiedOn DateTime
  asvModifiedBy String
  setting app_setting_def [not null]
  company companys
  branch branch_master
  device device_master
  user user_master

  Note: 'Overrides — one row per (setting, scope target).
A row exists only where somebody changed something. "Reset to default" is a
DELETE, never a write of the default value.'
}

